{
    "title": "365Scores: Live Scores & News",
    "description": "Be the 1st to Know with 365Scores - The complete sports experience!\r\n \r\nFollow the best of sports including major soccer competitions: UEFA Champions League, English Premier League, Spanish LaLiga; as well as the NBA, NFL, NHL, Wimbledon and MORE!\r\nJoin over 110 million die-hard sports fans who enjoy Live Scores, News Updates, In-Depth Stats, Upcoming Schedule and League Standings.\r\n\r\nThe Pick'Em game is back!\r\nAs in every major soccer tournament, this summer, we are waiting for you and your friends with the leading and fastest Pick'Em game in the world, where you can compete with your friends on predicting the results of the games, who will be the champion and who will be the top scorer - and like everything in the 365Scores app, all the results, the tables, and the scorers - update LIVE - faster than anyone else. Join now and invite your friends to play!\r\n \r\nFOLLOW YOUR TEAM\r\nNo matter who\u2019s your team, 365Scores brings you EVERYTHING that you need:\r\nLive Scores, Sports News, Roster Updates, Signings and Trades, Real-Time Stats, In-Match Commentary, Upcoming Schedule, League Standings, and Social Buzz Feed.\r\n \r\nOWN YOUR SCOREBOARD\r\nChoose the teams and leagues you want to follow or pick games instantly!\r\n \r\nDON\u2019T MISS A THING\r\nWarning! Our live game notifications may be faster than your game stream!\r\nExperience our Live Game Tracker, the best way to feel the game when you can't watch it!\r\n \r\nWORLDWIDE SPORTS CALENDAR\r\nCheck our ALL SCORES tab, the most updated multi-sport calendar that you can find.\r\n365Scores delivers full coverage of 10 sports: Soccer, Basketball, Football, Ice Hockey, Tennis, Baseball, Cricket, Handball, Rugby and Volleyball - with more than 2,000 competitions, including: UEFA Champions League, English Premier League, Spanish LaLiga, German Bundesliga, Italian Serie A, NBA, NFL, NHL, MLB, Wimbledon, IPL and much more!\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re always happy for any feedback! \r\nContact us:\r\nEmail: contact@365scores.com\r\nPhone: +44 1438 940632\r\nFacebook:  http://www.facebook.com/365scores\r\nTwitter:  http://www.twitter.com/365scores\r\nInstagram:  http://www.instagram.com/365scores",
